{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e6239f9d36ff02b3","name":"Rocky Ground","source":{"id":"source:reference-e6239f9d36ff02b3","title":"Rocky Ground","revision":21425,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:46:42Z","sha256":"2541d4ef0c5f638ff22688866359278ca6017eb45f59d224e8c29a629f0ea7e7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21425","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rocky%20Ground&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e6239f9d36ff02b3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Small stones and rubble litter the floor, making it difficult to keep your balance and to move quickly."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Rocky Ground is common in caves and probably will be present in any subterranean encounter. To increase the peril of this Hazard and add more excitement, use rocky ground near cliffs, pits, and other features that create the possibility of a dangerous fall. An epic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," duel on rocky ground atop a cliff overlooking a lava flow might be a memorable battle. Likewise, Rocky Ground can add an extra element of danger to combat that takes place around a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sinkhole"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sinkhole","referenceId":"reference:af62ea4e24ca3cce"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Rocky Ground Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being begins its turn on Rocky Ground.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +4 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," Special (See Below)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains on the Rocky Ground.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," (DC 14):"]}," The character leaps over the rubble, gaining a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to avoid the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," (DC 19):"]}," Using the same technique used for moving silently, the character slows his or her movement to half ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," to avoid taking damage."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If the Hazard's attack against the target succeeds, the target falls ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"},". If the Hazard's attack roll exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," by 5 or more, the target falls ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," and also moves backward 1 square.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
